This port provides the amr(4) kernel module for LSI Logic / American Megatrends
MegaRAID SCSI/ATA/SATA RAID controllers.

The amr(4) driver was removed from the FreeBSD base system before FreeBSD 14.0.
This port allows users with MegaRAID hardware (e.g., Dell PowerEdge servers)
to continue using their RAID controllers on FreeBSD 14.x and later.

The port builds two kernel modules:
  amr.ko     - Core MegaRAID driver (PCI attachment, disk interface)
  amr_cam.ko - CAM interface for SCSI passthrough
